---
source: src/cli/tests.rs
expression: "Cli::command().render_long_help().to_string()"
---
TUI and CLI for downloading HuggingFace models.

Run without a subcommand to start the interactive TUI.

Usage: rust-hf-downloader [COMMAND]

Commands:
  download  One-shot model download (non-interactive, script/AI-friendly)
  hf-cache  Populate the HuggingFace hub cache for offline serving (vLLM, transformers)
  search    Search HuggingFace models (query-only; prints a table or a JSON array)
  update    Update the installed binary to the newest release
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
